    <p>Typical Example</p>
    <p>Fuses protect the electrical system from damage caused by overloaded circuits. Change a fuse if the element separates. If the element of a new fuse separates, have the circuit checked and repaired.</p>
    <p>For detailed information, refer to “Fuses, Bulbs &amp; Circuit Breaker - Change, Reset” in Maintenance Section.</p>
